Package: buscalogo-agent
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libappindicator3-1 | libayatana-appindicator3-1, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37, libnss3-tools
Maintainer: BuscaLogo <contato@buscalogo.com>
Description: BuscaLogo Agent
 Agente local para hospedagem de sites .bl, DNS CoreDNS,
 Yggdrasil, CouchDB, scraper e painel de gerenciamento.
 Inclui interface desktop nativa (Neutralinojs).
 Instala a CA raiz no SO, no NSS (Firefox Snap/Chrome/Brave via
 certutil) e nos IDEs (Cursor/VS Code/Trae/Node); ativa
 security.enterprise_roots no Firefox para usar a CA do sistema.
